{"ok": true, "summary": "The concept assembly uses a 260 × 160 × 60 mm engineering-plastic manifold containing two straight Ø16 mm coolant passages. Mounted above it are a Ø60 × 70 mm aluminium five-way valve, a Ø70 × 90 mm aluminium pump with an outlet, and a 120 × 80 × 60 mm stainless-steel chiller represented by 20 spaced plates. Two Ø16 mm quick-connect fittings attach to the manifold ends. Section view exposes the main passages; exploded view moves each mounted component independently. Mass estimates use assumed 3 mm aluminium housing walls, 0.5 mm chiller plates and hollow plastic fittings. Motor, actuator internals, seals, fasteners and unspecified internal routing are excluded, so the reported mass is a conceptual material estimate, not a production weight.", "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>EV Integrated Thermal-Management Module</title>\n<style>\nhtml,body{margin:0;overflow:hidden;height:100%;font-family:\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif}\ncanvas{display:block}\n#panel{position:absolute;top:12px;left:12px;max-width:300px;padding:12px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.88);border:1px solid #dedede;border-radius:8px;font-size:12px;color:#26323b}\n#panel h3{font-size:14px;margin:0 0 7px}\n.line{margin:4px 0}\n.legend{font-size:11px}\nbutton{background:white;border:1px solid #dedede;border-radius:6px;padding:4px 10px;font:inherit;cursor:pointer}\nbutton:hover{border-color:#b11f4b}\n.buttons{display:flex;gap:4px;margin-top:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}\n#error{display:none;position:absolute;top:45%;left:15%;width:70%;color:#bd1627;background:white;padding:16px;text-align:center}\n#hint{position:absolute;bottom:12px;right:14px;font-size:12px;color:#52606a}\n</style>\n<script type=\"importmap\">{\"imports\":{\"three\":\"/static/vendor/three/three.module.js\",\"three/addons/\":\"/static/vendor/three/jsm/\"}}</script>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div id=\"panel\">\n<h3>EV Thermal-Management Module</h3>\n<div class=\"line\">Manifold: 260 × 160 × 60 mm; 2 × Ø16</div>\n<div class=\"line\">Valve: Ø60 × 70; pump: Ø70 × 90 mm</div>\n<div class=\"line\">Chiller: 120 × 80 × 60 mm; 20 plates</div>\n<div class=\"line\" id=\"counts\"></div>\n<div class=\"line\" id=\"masses\"></div>\n<div class=\"line\" id=\"total\"></div>\n<div class=\"line legend\">■ Plastic: charcoal · ■ Aluminium: silver</div>\n<div class=\"line legend\">■ Stainless: grey · <span style=\"color:#3b82f6\">■ Coolant: blue</span></div>\n<div class=\"buttons\"><button id=\"section\">Section view</button><button id=\"explode\">Exploded view</button><button id=\"rotate\">Auto-rotate: on</button></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"hint\">Drag to orbit · Scroll to zoom · Concept only</div>\n<div id=\"error\"></div>\n<script type=\"module\">\nimport * as THREE from 'three';\nimport { OrbitControls } from 'three/addons/controls/OrbitControls.js';\nimport { RoomEnvironment } from 'three/addons/environments/RoomEnvironment.js';\nconst P = {\n  // Dimensions in mm; densities in g/cm³. Unspecified internals excluded.\n  manifold:{length:260,width:160,height:60,passageDiameter:16,passageCount:2,passageOffset:45},\n  valve:{diameter:60,height:70,wall:3,ports:5,portOuter:12,portInner:8,portLength:12},\n  pump:{diameter:70,height:90,wall:3,outletOuter:20,outletInner:16,outletLength:25},\n  chiller:{length:120,width:80,height:60,plates:20,plateThickness:0.5},\n  fitting:{count:2,outer:16,inner:12,length:28,collarDiameter:22,collarLength:6},\n  density:{plastic:1.40,aluminium:2.70,stainless:7.90},\n  layout:{valve:[-85,30,-35],pump:[-10,30,30],chiller:[65,30,-35],\n    fittingA:[-130,0,-45],fittingB:[130,0,45]},\n  explode:{valve:[-65,70,-25],pump:[0,100,65],chiller:[80,65,-30],\n    fittingA:[-65,0,0],fittingB:[65,0,0]},\n  colors:{aluminium:'#d4d9e0',plastic:'#2b2b2b',stainless:'#9aa3ab',coolant:'#3b82f6'}\n};\nconst showError = message => {\n  const node=document.getElementById('error');\n  node.style.display='block';node.textContent='Model error: '+message;\n};\nwindow.addEventListener('error',event=>showError(event.message));\ntry {\n  const scene=new THREE.Scene();\n  scene.background=new THREE.Color('#f7f4ef');\n  const renderer=new THREE.WebGLRenderer({antialias:true,preserveDrawingBuffer:true});\n  renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(devicePixelRatio,2));\n  renderer.setSize(innerWidth,innerHeight);\n  renderer.localClippingEnabled=true;\n  document.body.appendChild(renderer.domElement);\n  const pmrem=new THREE.PMREMGenerator(renderer);\n  scene.environment=pmrem.fromScene(new RoomEnvironment(),0.04).texture;\n  scene.add(new THREE.HemisphereLight(0xffffff,0x8d8d8d,0.6));\n  const light=new THREE.DirectionalLight(0xffffff,1.2);\n  light.position.set(200,400,250);scene.add(light);\n  const camera=new THREE.PerspectiveCamera(40,innerWidth/innerHeight,1,20000);\n  const controls=new OrbitControls(camera,renderer.domElement);\n  controls.enableDamping=true;controls.autoRotate=true;controls.autoRotateSpeed=1.0;\n  const modelGroup=new THREE.Group();scene.add(modelGroup);\n  const metal=color=>new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({color,metalness:0.85,roughness:0.35});\n  const aluminium=metal(P.colors.aluminium),steel=metal(P.colors.stainless);\n  const plastic=new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({color:P.colors.plastic,metalness:0,roughness:0.6});\n  const fluid=new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({color:P.colors.coolant,transparent:true,opacity:0.55,depthWrite:false,roughness:0.35});\n  const manifoldMaterial=plastic.clone();\n  const add=(parent,geometry,material,position=[0,0,0])=>{\n    const mesh=new THREE.Mesh(geometry,material);mesh.position.set(...position);parent.add(mesh);return mesh;\n  };\n  const box=(parent,x,y,z,material,position)=>add(parent,new THREE.BoxGeometry(x,y,z),material,position);\n  function ringGeometry(outer,inner,length){\n    const shape=new THREE.Shape();\n    shape.absarc(0,0,outer/2,0,Math.PI*2,false);\n    const hole=new THREE.Path();hole.absarc(0,0,inner/2,0,Math.PI*2,true);\n    shape.holes.push(hole);\n    return new THREE.ExtrudeGeometry(shape,{depth:length,bevelEnabled:false,curveSegments:32});\n  }\n  function tube(parent,outer,inner,length,material,position,direction){\n    const mesh=add(parent,ringGeometry(outer,inner,length),material,position);\n    mesh.quaternion.setFromUnitVectors(new THREE.Vector3(0,0,1),new THREE.Vector3(...direction).normalize());\n    return mesh;\n  }\n  const m=P.manifold,v=P.valve,p=P.pump,c=P.chiller,f=P.fitting;\n  // Extruded manifold has genuine through-bores along X.\n  const shape=new THREE.Shape();\n  shape.moveTo(-m.height/2,-m.width/2);shape.lineTo(m.height/2,-m.width/2);\n  shape.lineTo(m.height/2,m.width/2);shape.lineTo(-m.height/2,m.width/2);shape.closePath();\n  for(const z of [-m.passageOffset,m.passageOffset]){\n    const hole=new THREE.Path();hole.absarc(0,z,m.passageDiameter/2,0,Math.PI*2,true);shape.holes.push(hole);\n  }\n  const body=add(modelGroup,new THREE.ExtrudeGeometry(shape,{depth:m.length,bevelEnabled:false,curveSegments:40}),manifoldMaterial);\n  body.rotation.set(Math.PI/2,0,Math.PI/2);body.position.x=-m.length/2;\n  for(const z of [-m.passageOffset,m.passageOffset]){\n    const coolant=add(modelGroup,new THREE.CylinderGeometry(m.passageDiameter/2,m.passageDiameter/2,m.length,32),fluid,[0,0,z]);\n    coolant.rotation.z=Math.PI/2;\n  }\n  const moving=[];\n  function assembly(name){\n    const group=new THREE.Group();group.position.set(...P.layout[name]);modelGroup.add(group);\n    moving.push({group,base:group.position.clone(),offset:new THREE.Vector3(...P.explode[name])});return group;\n  }\n  function housing(group,d){\n    tube(group,d.diameter,d.diameter-2*d.wall,d.height,aluminium,[0,0,0],[0,1,0]);\n    for(const y of [d.wall/2,d.height-d.wall/2])\n      add(group,new THREE.CylinderGeometry(d.diameter/2-d.wall,d.diameter/2-d.wall,d.wall,48),aluminium,[0,y,0]);\n  }\n  const valve=assembly('valve');housing(valve,v);\n  for(let i=0;i<v.ports;i++){\n    const angle=i*2*Math.PI/v.ports;\n    const direction=[Math.cos(angle),0,Math.sin(angle)];\n    tube(valve,v.portOuter,v.portInner,v.portLength,aluminium,[direction[0]*v.diameter/2,v.height*0.45,direction[2]*v.diameter/2],direction);\n  }\n  const pump=assembly('pump');housing(pump,p);\n  tube(pump,p.outletOuter,p.outletInner,p.outletLength,aluminium,[0,p.height*0.65,p.diameter/2],[0,0,1]);\n  const chiller=assembly('chiller');\n  const gap=(c.height-c.plates*c.plateThickness)/(c.plates-1);\n  for(let i=0;i<c.plates;i++)\n    box(chiller,c.length,c.plateThickness,c.width,steel,[0,c.plateThickness/2+i*(c.plateThickness+gap),0]);\n  // Alternate gaps represent conceptual coolant layers, not validated routing.\n  for(let i=0;i<c.plates-1;i+=2)\n    box(chiller,c.length-4,gap,c.width-4,fluid,[0,c.plateThickness+i*(c.plateThickness+gap)+gap/2,0]);\n  for(const [name,sign] of [['fittingA',-1],['fittingB',1]]){\n    const fitting=assembly(name);\n    tube(fitting,f.outer,f.inner,f.length,plastic,[0,0,0],[sign,0,0]);\n    tube(fitting,f.collarDiameter,f.outer,f.collarLength,plastic,[sign*6,0,0],[sign,0,0]);\n  }\n  const grid=new THREE.GridHelper(650,26,0xd8d3ca,0xe6e1d9);grid.position.y=-m.height/2-1;scene.add(grid);\n  const annulus=(od,id,length)=>Math.PI*(od*od-id*id)*length/4;\n  const shell=d=>Math.PI*(d.diameter*d.diameter*d.height-(d.diameter-2*d.wall)**2*(d.height-2*d.wall))/4;\n  const manifoldMass=(m.length*m.width*m.height-m.passageCount*Math.PI*(m.passageDiameter/2)**2*m.length)*P.density.plastic/1e6;\n  const valveMass=(shell(v)+v.ports*annulus(v.portOuter,v.portInner,v.portLength))*P.density.aluminium/1e6;\n  const pumpMass=(shell(p)+annulus(p.outletOuter,p.outletInner,p.outletLength))*P.density.aluminium/1e6;\n  const chillerMass=c.length*c.width*c.plates*c.plateThickness*P.density.stainless/1e6;\n  const fittingMass=(annulus(f.outer,f.inner,f.length)+annulus(f.collarDiameter,f.outer,f.collarLength))*P.density.plastic/1e6;\n  const totalMass=manifoldMass+valveMass+pumpMass+chillerMass+f.count*fittingMass;\n  window.__metrics=[\n    {label:'Part count',value:String(4+f.count),unit:'pcs',note:'Top-level parts; chiller is one assembly'},\n    {label:'Manifold mass',value:manifoldMass.toFixed(3),unit:'kg',note:'Plastic; two through-bores deducted'},\n    {label:'Valve mass',value:valveMass.toFixed(3),unit:'kg',note:'3 mm Al shell and five hollow ports'},\n    {label:'Pump mass',value:pumpMass.toFixed(3),unit:'kg',note:'3 mm Al shell and hollow outlet'},\n    {label:'Chiller mass',value:chillerMass.toFixed(3),unit:'kg',note:'20 stainless plates, 0.5 mm each'},\n    {label:'Total module mass',value:totalMass.toFixed(3),unit:'kg',note:`Includes ${f.count} fittings at ${fittingMass.toFixed(4)} kg each`}\n  ];\n  document.getElementById('counts').textContent=`Parts: ${4+f.count} top-level; fittings: ${fittingMass.toFixed(4)} kg each`;\n  document.getElementById('masses').textContent=`Mass kg: manifold ${manifoldMass.toFixed(3)} · valve ${valveMass.toFixed(3)} · pump ${pumpMass.toFixed(3)} · chiller ${chillerMass.toFixed(3)}`;\n  document.getElementById('total').textContent=`Total: ${totalMass.toFixed(3)} kg · excludes functional internals`;\n  function fit(){\n    modelGroup.updateMatrixWorld(true);\n    const bounds=new THREE.Box3().setFromObject(modelGroup,true);\n    const center=bounds.getCenter(new THREE.Vector3()),radius=bounds.getSize(new THREE.Vector3()).length()/2;\n    const angle=Math.min(THREE.MathUtils.degToRad(40)/2,Math.atan(Math.tan(THREE.MathUtils.degToRad(40)/2)*camera.aspect));\n    camera.position.copy(center).add(new THREE.Vector3(1,0.7,1.2).normalize().multiplyScalar(radius/Math.sin(angle)/0.75));\n    controls.target.copy(center);controls.update();\n  }\n  let section=false,exploded=false;\n  document.getElementById('section').onclick=()=>{\n    section=!section;manifoldMaterial.clippingPlanes=section?[new THREE.Plane(new THREE.Vector3(0,-1,0),0)]:[];\n    manifoldMaterial.needsUpdate=true;document.getElementById('section').textContent=section?'Full view':'Section view';\n  };\n  document.getElementById('explode').onclick=()=>{\n    exploded=!exploded;\n    moving.forEach(item=>item.group.position.copy(item.base).addScaledVector(item.offset,exploded?1:0));\n    document.getElementById('explode').textContent=exploded?'Assembled view':'Exploded view';fit();\n  };\n  const rotationButton=document.getElementById('rotate');\n  const updateRotation=()=>rotationButton.textContent='Auto-rotate: '+(controls.autoRotate?'on':'off');\n  rotationButton.onclick=()=>{controls.autoRotate=!controls.autoRotate;updateRotation();};\n  controls.addEventListener('start',()=>{controls.autoRotate=false;updateRotation();});\n  window.addEventListener('resize',()=>{camera.aspect=innerWidth/innerHeight;camera.updateProjectionMatrix();renderer.setSize(innerWidth,innerHeight);});\n  Object.assign(window,{__scene:scene,__camera:camera,__renderer:renderer,__controls:controls,__model:modelGroup});\n  fit();\n  renderer.setAnimationLoop(()=>{controls.update();renderer.render(scene,camera);});\n} catch(error){showError(error.message);}\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>", "metrics": [{"label": "Part count", "value": "6", "unit": "pcs", "note": "Top-level parts; chiller is one assembly"}, {"label": "Manifold mass", "value": "3.348", "unit": "kg", "note": "Plastic; two through-bores deducted"}, {"label": "Valve mass", "value": "0.149", "unit": "kg", "note": "3 mm Al shell and five hollow ports"}, {"label": "Pump mass", "value": "0.187", "unit": "kg", "note": "3 mm Al shell and hollow outlet"}, {"label": "Chiller mass", "value": "0.758", "unit": "kg", "note": "20 stainless plates, 0.5 mm each"}, {"label": "Total module mass", "value": "4.452", "unit": "kg", "note": "Includes 2 fittings at 0.0050 kg each"}], "suggestions": ["Add realistic pump and valve internals and update the mass estimate.", "Add mounting bosses, fasteners, seals and a production-style chiller enclosure.", "Connect all five valve ports and show the coolant routing in section view."], "raw": "<<<SUMMARY>>>\nThe concept assembly uses a 260 × 160 × 60 mm engineering-plastic manifold containing two straight Ø16 mm coolant passages. Mounted above it are a Ø60 × 70 mm aluminium five-way valve, a Ø70 × 90 mm aluminium pump with an outlet, and a 120 × 80 × 60 mm stainless-steel chiller represented by 20 spaced plates. Two Ø16 mm quick-connect fittings attach to the manifold ends. Section view exposes the main passages; exploded view moves each mounted component independently. Mass estimates use assumed 3 mm aluminium housing walls, 0.5 mm chiller plates and hollow plastic fittings. Motor, actuator internals, seals, fasteners and unspecified internal routing are excluded, so the reported mass is a conceptual material estimate, not a production weight.\n<<<HTML>>>\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>EV Integrated Thermal-Management Module</title>\n<style>\nhtml,body{margin:0;overflow:hidden;height:100%;font-family:\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif}\ncanvas{display:block}\n#panel{position:absolute;top:12px;left:12px;max-width:300px;padding:12px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.88);border:1px solid #dedede;border-radius:8px;font-size:12px;color:#26323b}\n#panel h3{font-size:14px;margin:0 0 7px}\n.line{margin:4px 0}\n.legend{font-size:11px}\nbutton{background:white;border:1px solid #dedede;border-radius:6px;padding:4px 10px;font:inherit;cursor:pointer}\nbutton:hover{border-color:#b11f4b}\n.buttons{display:flex;gap:4px;margin-top:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}\n#error{display:none;position:absolute;top:45%;left:15%;width:70%;color:#bd1627;background:white;padding:16px;text-align:center}\n#hint{position:absolute;bottom:12px;right:14px;font-size:12px;color:#52606a}\n</style>\n<script type=\"importmap\">{\"imports\":{\"three\":\"/static/vendor/three/three.module.js\",\"three/addons/\":\"/static/vendor/three/jsm/\"}}</script>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div id=\"panel\">\n<h3>EV Thermal-Management Module</h3>\n<div class=\"line\">Manifold: 260 × 160 × 60 mm; 2 × Ø16</div>\n<div class=\"line\">Valve: Ø60 × 70; pump: Ø70 × 90 mm</div>\n<div class=\"line\">Chiller: 120 × 80 × 60 mm; 20 plates</div>\n<div class=\"line\" id=\"counts\"></div>\n<div class=\"line\" id=\"masses\"></div>\n<div class=\"line\" id=\"total\"></div>\n<div class=\"line legend\">■ Plastic: charcoal · ■ Aluminium: silver</div>\n<div class=\"line legend\">■ Stainless: grey · <span style=\"color:#3b82f6\">■ Coolant: blue</span></div>\n<div class=\"buttons\"><button id=\"section\">Section view</button><button id=\"explode\">Exploded view</button><button id=\"rotate\">Auto-rotate: on</button></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"hint\">Drag to orbit · Scroll to zoom · Concept only</div>\n<div id=\"error\"></div>\n<script type=\"module\">\nimport * as THREE from 'three';\nimport { OrbitControls } from 'three/addons/controls/OrbitControls.js';\nimport { RoomEnvironment } from 'three/addons/environments/RoomEnvironment.js';\nconst P = {\n  // Dimensions in mm; densities in g/cm³. Unspecified internals excluded.\n  manifold:{length:260,width:160,height:60,passageDiameter:16,passageCount:2,passageOffset:45},\n  valve:{diameter:60,height:70,wall:3,ports:5,portOuter:12,portInner:8,portLength:12},\n  pump:{diameter:70,height:90,wall:3,outletOuter:20,outletInner:16,outletLength:25},\n  chiller:{length:120,width:80,height:60,plates:20,plateThickness:0.5},\n  fitting:{count:2,outer:16,inner:12,length:28,collarDiameter:22,collarLength:6},\n  density:{plastic:1.40,aluminium:2.70,stainless:7.90},\n  layout:{valve:[-85,30,-35],pump:[-10,30,30],chiller:[65,30,-35],\n    fittingA:[-130,0,-45],fittingB:[130,0,45]},\n  explode:{valve:[-65,70,-25],pump:[0,100,65],chiller:[80,65,-30],\n    fittingA:[-65,0,0],fittingB:[65,0,0]},\n  colors:{aluminium:'#d4d9e0',plastic:'#2b2b2b',stainless:'#9aa3ab',coolant:'#3b82f6'}\n};\nconst showError = message => {\n  const node=document.getElementById('error');\n  node.style.display='block';node.textContent='Model error: '+message;\n};\nwindow.addEventListener('error',event=>showError(event.message));\ntry {\n  const scene=new THREE.Scene();\n  scene.background=new THREE.Color('#f7f4ef');\n  const renderer=new THREE.WebGLRenderer({antialias:true,preserveDrawingBuffer:true});\n  renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(devicePixelRatio,2));\n  renderer.setSize(innerWidth,innerHeight);\n  renderer.localClippingEnabled=true;\n  document.body.appendChild(renderer.domElement);\n  const pmrem=new THREE.PMREMGenerator(renderer);\n  scene.environment=pmrem.fromScene(new RoomEnvironment(),0.04).texture;\n  scene.add(new THREE.HemisphereLight(0xffffff,0x8d8d8d,0.6));\n  const light=new THREE.DirectionalLight(0xffffff,1.2);\n  light.position.set(200,400,250);scene.add(light);\n  const camera=new THREE.PerspectiveCamera(40,innerWidth/innerHeight,1,20000);\n  const controls=new OrbitControls(camera,renderer.domElement);\n  controls.enableDamping=true;controls.autoRotate=true;controls.autoRotateSpeed=1.0;\n  const modelGroup=new THREE.Group();scene.add(modelGroup);\n  const metal=color=>new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({color,metalness:0.85,roughness:0.35});\n  const aluminium=metal(P.colors.aluminium),steel=metal(P.colors.stainless);\n  const plastic=new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({color:P.colors.plastic,metalness:0,roughness:0.6});\n  const fluid=new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({color:P.colors.coolant,transparent:true,opacity:0.55,depthWrite:false,roughness:0.35});\n  const manifoldMaterial=plastic.clone();\n  const add=(parent,geometry,material,position=[0,0,0])=>{\n    const mesh=new THREE.Mesh(geometry,material);mesh.position.set(...position);parent.add(mesh);return mesh;\n  };\n  const box=(parent,x,y,z,material,position)=>add(parent,new THREE.BoxGeometry(x,y,z),material,position);\n  function ringGeometry(outer,inner,length){\n    const shape=new THREE.Shape();\n    shape.absarc(0,0,outer/2,0,Math.PI*2,false);\n    const hole=new THREE.Path();hole.absarc(0,0,inner/2,0,Math.PI*2,true);\n    shape.holes.push(hole);\n    return new THREE.ExtrudeGeometry(shape,{depth:length,bevelEnabled:false,curveSegments:32});\n  }\n  function tube(parent,outer,inner,length,material,position,direction){\n    const mesh=add(parent,ringGeometry(outer,inner,length),material,position);\n    mesh.quaternion.setFromUnitVectors(new THREE.Vector3(0,0,1),new THREE.Vector3(...direction).normalize());\n    return mesh;\n  }\n  const m=P.manifold,v=P.valve,p=P.pump,c=P.chiller,f=P.fitting;\n  // Extruded manifold has genuine through-bores along X.\n  const shape=new THREE.Shape();\n  shape.moveTo(-m.height/2,-m.width/2);shape.lineTo(m.height/2,-m.width/2);\n  shape.lineTo(m.height/2,m.width/2);shape.lineTo(-m.height/2,m.width/2);shape.closePath();\n  for(const z of [-m.passageOffset,m.passageOffset]){\n    const hole=new THREE.Path();hole.absarc(0,z,m.passageDiameter/2,0,Math.PI*2,true);shape.holes.push(hole);\n  }\n  const body=add(modelGroup,new THREE.ExtrudeGeometry(shape,{depth:m.length,bevelEnabled:false,curveSegments:40}),manifoldMaterial);\n  body.rotation.set(Math.PI/2,0,Math.PI/2);body.position.x=-m.length/2;\n  for(const z of [-m.passageOffset,m.passageOffset]){\n    const coolant=add(modelGroup,new THREE.CylinderGeometry(m.passageDiameter/2,m.passageDiameter/2,m.length,32),fluid,[0,0,z]);\n    coolant.rotation.z=Math.PI/2;\n  }\n  const moving=[];\n  function assembly(name){\n    const group=new THREE.Group();group.position.set(...P.layout[name]);modelGroup.add(group);\n    moving.push({group,base:group.position.clone(),offset:new THREE.Vector3(...P.explode[name])});return group;\n  }\n  function housing(group,d){\n    tube(group,d.diameter,d.diameter-2*d.wall,d.height,aluminium,[0,0,0],[0,1,0]);\n    for(const y of [d.wall/2,d.height-d.wall/2])\n      add(group,new THREE.CylinderGeometry(d.diameter/2-d.wall,d.diameter/2-d.wall,d.wall,48),aluminium,[0,y,0]);\n  }\n  const valve=asse